# Silas Cray, Acting Harbourmaster, in Bramwick's chair.
dialogue cray4
  node root silas "The clerk! Back from the dead. Or from the sea, which is worse. I'm Acting Harbourmaster. Bramwick was suspended for “conduct”. Do sit."
    -> hub
  node hub silas "Well? I bill by the hour. Tonight the harbour pays, so take your time."
    > "You emptied six ships." if not seen:cray4.six -> six
    > "You'll never get the compass." if not seen:cray4.compass -> compass
    > "What happens at the dawn bell?" if not seen:cray4.bell -> bell
    > "Where's Bramwick?" if not seen:cray4.where -> where
    > "You told me to swim." if (seen:silas.swim or seen:silas.swim_offer) and not seen:cray4.swim -> swim
    > "I've got the harbour ledger." if has ledger and not seen:cray4.ledger -> ledger
    > "What about your offer?" if cray_offer and not seen:cray4.offer -> offer
    > "Goodnight, Acting Harbourmaster." -> bye
  node six silas "I insured six ships. The weather emptied them. I have the paperwork."
    -> smile
  node smile narrator "He smiles. It's a good smile, and I don't believe it."
    -> always
  node always silas "I always have the paperwork, clerk. That's the difference between us. You file it. I write it."
    -> hub
  node compass silas "I don't need it now. The whole Straits has seen where it points. A secret everyone knows is just a map."
    -> hub
  node bell silas "At the bell I close the book. The Marrow: lost, all hands, plague. Nobody questions a plague ship. They're too afraid of the answer."
    -> hub
  node where silas "Drinking at the Keel with an old navigator. I let him keep his hat. I'm not a monster. I'm an administrator."
    -> hub
  node swim silas "And you took a pirate ship instead. Less heroic, but drier. Your licence was impeccable. I checked. I check everything."
    -> hub
  node ledger silas "My dues, in Bramwick's hand. Bring it to the Keel at dawn. I'll be drinking to the Marrow's memory."
    -> hub
  node offer silas "Still open. The draught's worse in winter. The view is mostly people leaving. You'd get used to it."
    -> offer2
  node offer2 silas "I've kept the chair empty. It's the only thing in the building I never have to dust."
    -> hub
  node bye silas "Mind the bell, clerk. It rings for everyone. This morning I've asked it to ring mostly for you."
